ghtning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a> damage.</dd></dl>\n<ul><li>This hammer's magical powers only function if it's Bound to an <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\">Eldritch Knight</a> or is a <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a>'s Pact Weapon. These effects are in addition to the weapon's +1 enchantment.</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Belligerent_Skies\" title=\"Gloves of Belligerent Skies\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Gloves_of_Belligerent_Skies_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_of_Belligerent_Skies_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/d/d0/Gloves_of_Belligerent_Skies_Unfaded_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Gloves_of_Belligerent_Skies_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_of_Belligerent_Skies_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Gloves_of_Belligerent_Skies_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><br><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Belligerent_Skies\" title=\"Gloves of Belligerent Skies\"> <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Gloves of Belligerent Skies</span> </a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" title=\"Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/38px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gloves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/